      "reason": "Original VBE info allocator used sizeof(pointer) instead of the256-byte vbe_mode_info_t result; the BIOS query could overrun the allocation on original Minix. Allocate sizeof(*vmi_p). Actual owning vbe_get_info_mode allocation/BIOS fixture observed RED then GREEN and exact800x600x32 geometry. Original mode0x143 retained; missing runtime support was fixed separately in shared SDK using authoritative SeaBIOS mode table."
    }
