  "selection": "Pinned selected project with required sibling assets; generated docs, labs and OS/VCS/build metadata omitted.",
  "controlsRationale": "Original Enter chooses Play, WASD moves soldier once per make then resets movement state; repeatKeys provides held normal typematic. Relative canvas swipes aim the crosshair, dedicated mouse-left Fire launches shots, Space release pauses/resumes, ESC ends the round. Actual originalarena/zombies, soldier motion, aimed yellow projectile, timer/score advancement and pause passed. No generic keyboard/joystick or unsupported arrow controls.",
